WEBVTT

00:00:02.440 --> 00:00:06.650
<b>GUNDAM
VICTORY
MOBILE SUIT</b>

00:01:28.800 --> 00:01:31.560
A wedding was held in the POW camp...

00:01:31.800 --> 00:01:34.800
...in a strategy to make the guards grow careless.

00:01:35.200 --> 00:01:38.160
And because of an air raid launched on Macedonia colony,

00:01:38.200 --> 00:01:41.630
the Reineforce Junior's crew successfully escaped.

00:01:42.460 --> 00:01:44.860
However, Üso was captured...

00:01:45.030 --> 00:01:47.460
...by an enemy mobile suit using an Einerad.

00:01:47.730 --> 00:01:50.160
THE NEW SUIT: V2

00:01:50.160 --> 00:01:53.230
"The New Suit: V2".
THE NEW SUIT: V2

00:01:53.230 --> 00:01:53.260
"The New Suit: V2".

00:01:58.660 --> 00:02:02.630
Isn't the group we sent for the mobile suits back, yet?

00:02:02.760 --> 00:02:04.800
They'll be here soon! Hang on!

00:02:05.360 --> 00:02:06.160
Why, you!

00:02:07.960 --> 00:02:10.230
Where's Üso? Isn't he back, yet?

00:02:10.660 --> 00:02:12.730
They're putting up a surprisingly tough resistance.

00:02:12.760 --> 00:02:15.400
You guys don't have to be shooting guns too, do you?

00:02:15.630 --> 00:02:17.360
I couldn't shoot now if I wanted to!

00:02:17.400 --> 00:02:18.230
Odelo!

00:02:18.300 --> 00:02:18.760
Thanks!

00:02:18.800 --> 00:02:21.560
You too, Suzy?! Stop helping with the war!

00:02:29.600 --> 00:02:32.130
It's the mobile suits that were on display in the central plaza!

00:02:32.160 --> 00:02:34.700
Where are our force's mobile suits?!

00:02:38.300 --> 00:02:40.230
Üso's Victory isn't with them, is it?

00:02:40.260 --> 00:02:43.200
I see Oliver, Marbet, Juca, and Cony.

00:02:43.660 --> 00:02:45.630
We need to use anti-MS launchers!

00:02:46.260 --> 00:02:47.430
Are you nuts?!

00:02:48.160 --> 00:02:51.760
If we have a mobile suit fight in here and an engine blows,

00:02:51.800 --> 00:02:53.630
it'd take out the whole port!

00:02:53.900 --> 00:02:57.500
Don't use the launchers! Don't blow up any mobile suits!

00:03:00.500 --> 00:03:05.430
In the block that connects this space colony's port to the central core,

00:03:05.460 --> 00:03:08.930
Üso has been captured by BESPA mobile suits.

00:03:11.460 --> 00:03:14.360
Miss Katejina, it's you in there, isn't it? I can tell!

00:03:14.700 --> 00:03:17.930
When you grabbed the Core Fighter, I heard your breathing!

00:03:18.230 --> 00:03:21.660
And your hesitating just confirmed it! Miss Katejina!

00:03:21.860 --> 00:03:24.030
Why are you piloting a mobile suit?!

00:03:24.060 --> 00:03:27.130
If this is what's happened, then please, just kill me!

00:03:27.460 --> 00:03:29.400
You've already said too much!

00:03:34.000 --> 00:03:36.360
I wouldn't think of running, if I were you.

00:03:38.160 --> 00:03:40.630
You may be a kid, but if you're a Newtype,

00:03:40.660 --> 00:03:43.400
I'm not letting my guard down or your hands free!

00:03:44.600 --> 00:03:46.400
She's even stronger than Junko was!

00:03:47.860 --> 00:03:50.560
Lieutenant Lupe Cineau. H-He's all yours.

00:03:50.630 --> 00:03:55.060
Good idea. I'm more used to handling these situations.

00:03:55.330 --> 00:03:59.360
All hands, make seals tight and stand by! Assemble the mobile suits on deck!

00:04:01.330 --> 00:04:02.400
Hurry up and make seals tight!

00:04:02.430 --> 00:04:03.700
What about Üso?

00:04:04.930 --> 00:04:05.860
Miss Marbet!

00:04:05.930 --> 00:04:08.400
Don't worry, he'll be back soon.

00:04:08.900 --> 00:04:11.930
You're the one they're after.

00:04:13.630 --> 00:04:14.260
Right.

00:04:14.800 --> 00:04:18.600
Smash the bulkhead in front of us! Transfer energy to the main cannon!

00:04:21.960 --> 00:04:22.830
What?!

00:04:31.130 --> 00:04:32.360
A little too late!

00:04:37.760 --> 00:04:42.000
The prisoners ran, as well as stole back their ship after you'd repaired it.

00:04:42.600 --> 00:04:45.600
How do you expect to apologize to the Zanscare homeland for this?

00:04:45.930 --> 00:04:50.130
None of this would have happened if not for your raid.

00:04:50.160 --> 00:04:51.500
This is no joke!

00:04:51.860 --> 00:04:53.860
You told us that you had neither the Reineforce...

00:04:53.900 --> 00:04:57.330
...nor any League Militaire mobile suits.

00:04:57.800 --> 00:05:00.630
However, Commandant Cronicle had a feeling,

00:05:00.660 --> 00:05:02.700
and ordered us to investigate.

00:05:03.160 --> 00:05:05.230
Discovering the League Militaire here...

00:05:05.260 --> 00:05:08.500
...so unnerved us that we made hasty choices.

00:05:08.600 --> 00:05:12.260
That's how we ended up destroying your facilities.

00:05:12.530 --> 00:05:18.060
I... I see. But the Reineforce was never inside our space colony.

00:05:18.330 --> 00:05:19.630
You're certain of that?

00:05:19.900 --> 00:05:21.730
And there were no prisoners, either.

00:05:21.760 --> 00:05:22.930
That's right.

00:05:23.430 --> 00:05:24.560
Understood.

00:05:25.530 --> 00:05:27.800
From here on, I'll look after the boy.

00:05:27.860 --> 00:05:29.030
He's all yours.

00:05:29.200 --> 00:05:31.530
I'll stand watch in a mobile suit.

00:05:31.600 --> 00:05:32.300
Please.

00:05:33.000 --> 00:05:36.730
And don't let Macedonians touch our Einerads and Gedlavs.

00:05:36.760 --> 00:05:37.200
Yes, ma'am.

00:05:41.030 --> 00:05:43.960
If you're the white one's pilot,

00:05:44.000 --> 00:05:46.500
then I can have a little fun with you, right?

00:05:48.760 --> 00:05:49.900
Wrong!

00:05:50.630 --> 00:05:53.730
This kid is a pilot who will become a treasure to us.

00:05:53.960 --> 00:05:55.200
We're giving him a bath.

00:05:55.400 --> 00:05:56.300
A bath?

00:05:56.660 --> 00:05:57.460
Bath?

00:05:58.260 --> 00:06:01.560
Up! Time to drown you in the tub!

00:06:01.860 --> 00:06:05.600
That lady there can be scary enough to break you!

00:06:28.100 --> 00:06:28.930
Well?

00:06:29.360 --> 00:06:31.900
Their inspection robots didn't see me,

00:06:31.930 --> 00:06:34.230
so we could sneak inside the space colony.

00:06:34.260 --> 00:06:36.730
Then, can't we do what Shahkti said?

00:06:36.760 --> 00:06:40.060
They must have tightened security. There's no way!

00:06:40.630 --> 00:06:43.700
You idiot! Being that passive won't get anything accomplished.

00:06:43.930 --> 00:06:45.630
If none of us can go in,

00:06:45.800 --> 00:06:48.230
then why not send Haro and Flanders?

00:06:48.430 --> 00:06:51.300
That's right! Haro and Flanders!

00:06:51.930 --> 00:06:53.960
Go on, find Üso!

00:06:54.000 --> 00:06:54.960
Haro! Haro!

00:07:01.200 --> 00:07:03.430
We're counting on you, Haro, Flanders!

00:07:04.200 --> 00:07:04.830
Haro!

00:07:15.560 --> 00:07:17.300
What are they going to do to me?

00:07:18.700 --> 00:07:20.130
What are you doing?!

00:07:20.430 --> 00:07:22.330
Surely you don't need to ask.

00:07:22.600 --> 00:07:24.930
If you're a Newtype, then I want to make friends with you, kid.

00:07:24.960 --> 00:07:26.000
Friends?!

00:07:26.030 --> 00:07:27.430
Exactly.

00:07:30.100 --> 00:07:33.200
If you can pilot the white one at your age,

00:07:33.230 --> 00:07:36.530
then I want to test just what you're capable of!

00:07:37.060 --> 00:07:38.130
I can't!

00:07:38.430 --> 00:07:40.230
Knowing your career, kid,

00:07:40.260 --> 00:07:44.260
I think you're a Newtype, someone with abnormal abilities!

00:07:45.900 --> 00:07:48.230
You ready to accept our test?!

00:07:48.600 --> 00:07:51.430
Come on, I'm just a normal kid!

00:07:51.860 --> 00:07:54.960
I asked you nicely, now do as I said!

00:08:02.730 --> 00:08:04.430
I was going to be nice to you!

00:08:04.560 --> 00:08:05.400
Stop it!

00:08:05.430 --> 00:08:06.230
I won't!

00:08:06.260 --> 00:08:07.400
I'm sorry!

00:08:08.000 --> 00:08:10.460
Apologize, and I'll let you work with me!

00:08:11.900 --> 00:08:12.930
What are you...

00:08:14.400 --> 00:08:15.530
Lieutenant Lupe Cineau!

00:08:15.560 --> 00:08:17.060
Bring me my clothes!

00:08:17.100 --> 00:08:17.900
Yes, ma'am!

00:08:19.830 --> 00:08:21.130
Halt!

00:08:24.360 --> 00:08:25.430
Stop him!

00:08:25.560 --> 00:08:26.860
Lieutenant! Socks!

00:08:27.230 --> 00:08:29.160
Get away! Just get away from me!

00:08:37.130 --> 00:08:40.630
Even if the boy escapes, I'll wait for Lieutenant Lupe Cineau.

00:08:40.660 --> 00:08:42.430
Ma'am! I'll convey that message.

00:08:44.660 --> 00:08:48.400
If we let him loose, the kid will probably lead us to Shahkti.

00:08:49.330 --> 00:08:50.530
Come down!

00:08:50.760 --> 00:08:52.230
You wanna put these on, right?

00:08:54.300 --> 00:08:56.700
I know I can't just stay here, but...

00:08:58.500 --> 00:08:59.400
The Core Fighter!

00:09:03.330 --> 00:09:04.330
Aw, man!

00:09:06.100 --> 00:09:07.360
Flanders and Haro?!

00:09:07.800 --> 00:09:09.060
Haro! Haro!

00:09:09.800 --> 00:09:10.500
A dog!

00:09:10.530 --> 00:09:11.260
A big one!

00:09:13.860 --> 00:09:15.000
Hey, you little...

00:09:16.260 --> 00:09:17.030
Haro! Haro!

00:09:17.060 --> 00:09:18.760
Can you pop something out, Haro?

00:09:18.860 --> 00:09:19.730
Don't move!

00:09:23.360 --> 00:09:24.460
A mobile suit?!

00:09:24.500 --> 00:09:25.700
W-What?!

00:09:25.800 --> 00:09:27.030
It's just a projection!

00:09:28.230 --> 00:09:29.030
Haro, come!

00:09:29.260 --> 00:09:29.830
Haro!

00:09:34.730 --> 00:09:35.700
He escaped!

00:09:37.030 --> 00:09:39.330
Weren't you going to reason with the kid?

00:09:39.360 --> 00:09:42.400
Says the guy who let him slip through his fingers!

00:09:43.030 --> 00:09:44.300
What's wrong with your breast?

00:09:44.430 --> 00:09:45.360
It was bitten.

00:09:45.400 --> 00:09:47.060
Gedlav, launching!

00:09:49.160 --> 00:09:52.630
Well, that little gal's quick off the mark.

00:09:53.000 --> 00:09:54.230
We're going, too!

00:10:04.900 --> 00:10:07.900
That boy... Has he matured even more?

00:10:12.360 --> 00:10:14.660
I can't see, but is anyone tailing us?

00:10:15.000 --> 00:10:15.930
There! There!

00:10:16.730 --> 00:10:18.030
What is that?

00:10:18.600 --> 00:10:19.860
What's what?

00:10:20.430 --> 00:10:21.930
There's nothing there.

00:10:23.630 --> 00:10:25.000
The air's leaking!

00:10:36.560 --> 00:10:37.430
Here?

00:10:38.100 --> 00:10:38.960
Why?

00:10:40.130 --> 00:10:42.030
There's air leaking from here, too.

00:10:42.100 --> 00:10:43.130
Okay?

00:10:43.800 --> 00:10:45.360
What? Where?

00:10:48.330 --> 00:10:49.900
You're just going to have to deal with this!

00:10:53.660 --> 00:10:55.100
It can't be helped!

00:10:55.560 --> 00:10:57.430
If I don't plug the holes, we'll die!

00:11:03.730 --> 00:11:05.930
You saw the light from a tail nozzle?

00:11:05.960 --> 00:11:07.700
It's headed away from us.

00:11:07.960 --> 00:11:09.560
Something must have happened to Üso.

00:11:09.600 --> 00:11:10.330
Maybe.

00:11:10.430 --> 00:11:13.500
Look! I see three silhouettes, in pursuit!

00:11:13.700 --> 00:11:15.730
And we can't move from here!

00:11:23.330 --> 00:11:26.160
It's an SOS from Üso's Core Fighter!

00:11:26.360 --> 00:11:29.200
If the Macedonian army and BESPA are moving,

00:11:29.230 --> 00:11:31.160
the Reineforce needs to move, as well!

00:11:31.300 --> 00:11:32.900
All hands, make ready to attack!

00:11:32.930 --> 00:11:33.500
Aye!

00:11:33.630 --> 00:11:34.960
The course will be difficult!

00:11:35.230 --> 00:11:36.430
Don't go in too deep.

00:11:36.460 --> 00:11:37.460
Understood.

00:11:39.060 --> 00:11:41.130
It must be an SOS from Haro.

00:11:41.330 --> 00:11:44.730
Yeah, and since Haro can't go out into space by himself,

00:11:44.760 --> 00:11:46.430
then it means Üso's with him.

00:11:47.430 --> 00:11:49.960
When Shrike Team launches, be ready...

00:11:50.000 --> 00:11:54.200
...to play decoy to allow us to get away from the space colony!

00:11:54.600 --> 00:11:57.130
Okay, if the deck's clear, then move out!

00:12:00.660 --> 00:12:04.730
That Marbet. She used the colony's centrifugal force to fling herself away.

00:12:04.760 --> 00:12:06.160
Cony, get going!

00:12:14.960 --> 00:12:16.000
I don't see him!

00:12:18.700 --> 00:12:21.260
They'll find me next. Haro, I'm sorry!

00:12:21.800 --> 00:12:23.500
Where's the Reineforce Junior?!

00:12:41.630 --> 00:12:43.860
You've detected Minovsky particles...

00:12:43.900 --> 00:12:45.900
...around the Macedonia space colony?

00:12:46.700 --> 00:12:47.760
Shall we move in?

00:12:47.900 --> 00:12:50.800
It's still not definite that it's the Reineforce Junior,

00:12:50.830 --> 00:12:53.400
but we'll move in if you order us to, sir.

00:12:53.430 --> 00:12:57.330
No, I don't want to incite the Macedonian government further.

00:12:59.330 --> 00:13:00.900
Even Azis has come out here?

00:13:02.000 --> 00:13:04.860
I am not about to let that little girl capture that kid...

00:13:04.900 --> 00:13:07.060
...after the way he humiliated me!

00:13:07.260 --> 00:13:09.360
I'm the one who's going to punish him!

00:13:11.200 --> 00:13:12.800
Lieutenant Lupe Cineau, don't!

00:13:12.830 --> 00:13:15.830
We'll lure out the Reineforce Junior, then attack!

00:13:16.130 --> 00:13:18.930
Otherwise, there was no point in letting the Core Fighter escape!

00:13:20.430 --> 00:13:21.660
Can't I get away?!

00:13:24.000 --> 00:13:25.460
Out of the way, Flanders!

00:13:28.600 --> 00:13:31.800
My eyes... It's not getting blurry!

00:13:36.630 --> 00:13:39.560
A long-range mega-particle cannon! A battleship?!

00:13:40.160 --> 00:13:42.500
That didn't come from the direction of the Reineforce Junior!

00:13:44.630 --> 00:13:45.430
What?!

00:13:49.000 --> 00:13:50.600
Are reinforcements coming?

00:13:52.260 --> 00:13:53.630
Miss Marbet and the others!

00:13:55.030 --> 00:13:56.300
Run, Üso!

00:13:57.600 --> 00:13:59.800
The Reineforce Junior has moved out!

00:14:05.500 --> 00:14:07.960
How about you try picking on me?!

00:14:08.000 --> 00:14:09.130
Don't be so cocky!

00:14:09.860 --> 00:14:10.930
Marbet! Cony!

00:14:11.200 --> 00:14:13.860
There's two of the tires and one mobile suit!

00:14:14.300 --> 00:14:18.400
Team 2, suppress any Macedonian forces moving in from the rear!

00:14:18.560 --> 00:14:19.960
This is the White Ark.

00:14:19.960 --> 00:14:21.560
Üso, we're here to help!

00:14:21.960 --> 00:14:25.630
That's the White Ark? Does it have Victory aboard?

00:14:27.700 --> 00:14:29.360
Please, get us to that little plane.

00:14:29.630 --> 00:14:31.300
The one you called a Core Fighter?

00:14:31.360 --> 00:14:32.060
Right.

00:14:32.600 --> 00:14:34.360
Look, straight ahead! That's Haro!

00:14:37.700 --> 00:14:40.200
Sorry, but could we get that ball, too, please?

00:14:40.560 --> 00:14:41.530
On the left?

00:14:42.530 --> 00:14:44.030
Use the portside hatch!

00:14:44.130 --> 00:14:44.660
Right!

00:14:48.560 --> 00:14:49.960
That's Haro, all right.

00:14:50.030 --> 00:14:53.660
Tomáš... Üso... SOS...

00:14:53.700 --> 00:14:56.060
It's okay. We can recover him.

00:14:56.160 --> 00:14:58.160
I... see...

00:15:01.660 --> 00:15:02.630
That tire!

00:15:06.960 --> 00:15:07.730
Üso!

00:15:08.430 --> 00:15:09.160
Üso!

00:15:09.800 --> 00:15:10.600
Are you okay?

00:15:10.660 --> 00:15:12.860
Tomáš... I think so.

00:15:13.030 --> 00:15:14.200
Are you naked?

00:15:14.630 --> 00:15:15.830
Yeah. Huh?

00:15:15.900 --> 00:15:17.300
That's not Victory, is it?

00:15:20.130 --> 00:15:23.130
The thing is, the White Ark doesn't have a docking bay.

00:15:23.230 --> 00:15:25.630
There's no way you can get in it while you're naked.

00:15:25.660 --> 00:15:28.400
Have Haro blow a soap bubble! That might work.

00:15:28.430 --> 00:15:29.600
A soap bubble?!

00:15:31.430 --> 00:15:32.830
That small vessel!

00:15:34.460 --> 00:15:35.400
Roger!

00:15:35.530 --> 00:15:39.400
White Ark, once Üso's inside, rendezvous with the Reineforce Junior!

00:15:43.900 --> 00:15:45.830
You don't use tires in space!

00:15:48.730 --> 00:15:53.500
In a mobile suit with this Einerad, even I can fight the Victory!

00:15:54.060 --> 00:15:58.400
I'll humiliate that old bag Lupe Cineau and the League Militaire!

00:16:01.330 --> 00:16:05.200
The soap bubble's density will be pretty thick, so you should use a knife to pop it.

00:16:05.230 --> 00:16:09.200
Roger! Once Üso's inside, I just have to shut the door.

00:16:09.500 --> 00:16:12.600
Martina, have them increase the air density on the bridge, too!

00:16:12.630 --> 00:16:13.460
Right!

00:16:13.900 --> 00:16:15.930
Üso's opening the canopy!

00:16:17.700 --> 00:16:18.830
He's naked?!

00:16:22.760 --> 00:16:24.800
Closing the door! Martina!

00:16:26.100 --> 00:16:27.530
Üso! Flanders!

00:16:27.900 --> 00:16:29.360
Speak to me, Üso!

00:16:29.400 --> 00:16:30.830
Flanders, move!

00:16:31.260 --> 00:16:34.730
Sorry, can you get those handcuffs off him?

00:16:35.500 --> 00:16:37.460
Üso's totally naked.

00:16:37.600 --> 00:16:40.200
Yes, you can definitely say he's totally naked...

00:16:40.400 --> 00:16:41.730
Oh, look. His pee-pee.

00:16:45.000 --> 00:16:48.800
Am I holding back because I'm waiting for the Reineforce Junior?

00:16:49.160 --> 00:16:50.860
Are you sure you're up to this?

00:16:50.930 --> 00:16:52.060
Do your best!

00:16:52.330 --> 00:16:54.930
It's not like you two have anything to be embarrassed about...

00:16:56.000 --> 00:16:57.900
I'm borrowing the new mobile suit.

00:17:00.200 --> 00:17:02.530
Victory Gundam Type 2, huh?

00:17:08.700 --> 00:17:10.430
The console's totally identical.

00:17:11.460 --> 00:17:14.100
Canopy, closed. Cockpit, retracted.

00:17:14.660 --> 00:17:16.800
Voice print code, entered... Okay!

00:17:17.060 --> 00:17:18.600
If you're going, then do it fast!

00:17:18.760 --> 00:17:20.500
I want to make this ship more maneuverable.

00:17:20.700 --> 00:17:22.700
R-Right! Sorry!

00:17:26.030 --> 00:17:28.630
You've stood by me through a lot, Core Fighter...

00:17:29.860 --> 00:17:31.660
And you're sticking with me a little longer!

00:17:39.800 --> 00:17:43.260
You've spotted lights moving away from space colony Macedonia?

00:17:43.900 --> 00:17:45.900
It's the Reineforce Junior! Commandant!

00:17:46.230 --> 00:17:49.030
Right, capture it! Activate main engines!

00:18:01.160 --> 00:18:03.100
That light... Reinforcements?!

00:18:05.730 --> 00:18:06.530
What?!

00:18:11.360 --> 00:18:12.230
Impossible!

00:18:12.960 --> 00:18:13.960
Lieutenant Lupe Cineau!

00:18:15.760 --> 00:18:17.830
Miss Marbet! Sorry I'm late!

00:18:17.930 --> 00:18:18.700
Üso!

00:18:18.930 --> 00:18:20.530
I'm using the new Gundam!

00:18:26.100 --> 00:18:27.360
Miss Katejina!

00:18:27.400 --> 00:18:29.660
Please, just don't come at me anymore!

00:18:29.930 --> 00:18:31.300
If Üso's in that...

00:18:43.260 --> 00:18:44.100
A battleship?

00:18:44.400 --> 00:18:46.730
But, I've never seen a battleship like that.

00:18:47.800 --> 00:18:49.600
The Reineforce Junior's arrived!

00:18:50.160 --> 00:18:51.030
What?!

00:18:52.830 --> 00:18:53.600
I saw it!

00:18:53.630 --> 00:18:56.460
The incorrigible white mobile suit!

00:18:58.160 --> 00:19:01.660
A heart filled only with hate will get you killed!

00:19:07.160 --> 00:19:10.230
I can't believe what's behind that Core Fighter is human!

00:19:13.260 --> 00:19:14.900
I-Impossible!

00:19:22.960 --> 00:19:24.430
Evasive action, too slow!

00:19:24.600 --> 00:19:27.800
Right, full rudder! Don't get caught in the explosion!

00:19:48.700 --> 00:19:50.530
He totally was, Shahkti!

00:19:50.560 --> 00:19:51.700
Oh, my goodness!

00:19:52.460 --> 00:19:55.630
It's nothing to laugh about! It freaked me out!

00:19:56.030 --> 00:19:57.930
Its ease of use isn't bad.

00:19:58.130 --> 00:20:01.330
True. And thanks to Tomáš and others...

00:20:01.360 --> 00:20:04.400
...bringing it to us on the White Ark, Üso was saved.

00:20:04.900 --> 00:20:09.130
Well, the White Ark saved us, too, and escorted us.

00:20:09.160 --> 00:20:12.100
So, the Aeneas was able to reach the Moon?

00:20:12.130 --> 00:20:12.830
Yeah.

00:20:13.460 --> 00:20:14.700
What's wrong, Üso?

00:20:14.960 --> 00:20:17.060
Is it because you shot down enemies on the battlefield?

00:20:17.100 --> 00:20:18.530
It's not that.

00:20:19.500 --> 00:20:20.660
Then what?

00:20:24.000 --> 00:20:26.530
The person who sent the design...

00:20:26.560 --> 00:20:29.900
...for the Victory Mk. II from Earth to the Moon...

00:20:29.930 --> 00:20:31.530
Her name is Myra Miggelle, right?

00:20:32.100 --> 00:20:34.860
That's my mother!

00:20:34.900 --> 00:20:38.900
How could you be so cruel and hide information about my parents from me?!

00:20:39.100 --> 00:20:41.830
Myra Miggelle is Üso's mother?!

00:20:42.330 --> 00:20:44.860
I explained it to him. I explained!

00:20:45.400 --> 00:20:48.230
But everyone in the League Militaire...

00:20:48.260 --> 00:20:52.030
...doesn't know each member's personal information.

00:20:52.130 --> 00:20:54.700
Üso just refuses to understand that.

00:20:55.600 --> 00:20:57.530
We had no idea that Hangerg Ewin...

00:20:57.560 --> 00:21:00.300
...and Myra Migelle were husband and wife.

00:21:00.330 --> 00:21:02.560
And now you all know, don't you?!

00:21:02.800 --> 00:21:05.160
Where are my father and mother?!

00:21:05.400 --> 00:21:07.060
You can tell me that much, can't you?!

00:21:07.530 --> 00:21:11.060
Üso's mother made this mobile suit?

00:21:11.360 --> 00:21:12.260
No way!

00:21:13.030 --> 00:21:17.300
Your mother is probably on the moon, near the League Militaire's factory,

00:21:17.330 --> 00:21:19.600
but I don't know where your father is.

00:21:19.630 --> 00:21:20.760
Why not?

00:21:21.230 --> 00:21:23.860
Because he's making our strategies.

00:21:23.930 --> 00:21:25.300
It always comes back to that!

00:21:25.330 --> 00:21:28.630
The people who do things for the war are the most important!

00:21:28.660 --> 00:21:31.700
Okay, then let's make it public knowledge...

00:21:31.730 --> 00:21:34.260
...that Üso Ewin is a Victory pilot.

00:21:34.300 --> 00:21:39.100
Then your dad and mom are sure to contact the Reineforce Junior.

00:21:39.130 --> 00:21:41.100
You haven't even done that yet?!

00:21:41.260 --> 00:21:43.100
They've never used your name.

00:21:43.260 --> 00:21:44.300
Why not?!

00:21:44.430 --> 00:21:46.300
Because this is a rebel movement.

00:21:46.430 --> 00:21:48.760
It's best to use names as little as possible.

00:21:49.400 --> 00:21:50.230
That's...

00:21:50.900 --> 00:21:54.460
Besides, as much as I'm scared of this machine called Victory,

00:21:54.500 --> 00:21:56.830
I think I'm starting to like this robot.

00:21:57.630 --> 00:22:00.660
Because it connects you with your mother.

00:22:01.330 --> 00:22:06.000
If it's a mobile suit that connects people, then I can like it.

00:23:29.760 --> 00:23:34.960
We saved a woman being chased by BESPA's secret police.

00:23:35.630 --> 00:23:40.800
But, amazingly, the woman turns out to be Üso's mother!

00:23:41.530 --> 00:23:44.360
That night, Mrs. Myra confesses to Üso...

00:23:44.560 --> 00:23:49.630
...how she's participated in the League Militaire's battle.

00:23:50.960 --> 00:23:53.400
Next time, on Mobile Suit Victory Gundam:

00:23:53.430 --> 00:23:56.500
Next Episode MOTHER'S GUNDAM
"Mother's Gundam".

00:23:56.500 --> 00:23:57.830
Please watch it!

00:23:57.830 --> 00:23:59.430
Next Episode MOTHER'S GUNDAM
